-- ccc6-offence-table.l4 -- the seam table of Part V (ss 150 to 182): given a provision of the Code, the class of the offence it creates and the punishments of its limbs.
-- It answers the questions other parts ask the offence sections (PLAN.md section 6: ccc26 ss 718.2, 718.3, 743.1; ccc14 ss 463 to 465; ccc1 ss 21 to 24; ccc20 ss 515, 522; ccc21 ss 553 to 555).
-- The provision is a core `Provision of the Code`: the subsection that creates the offence ("(1)") or "" for a section whose offences all have the same class. A provision that is not an offence of Part V
-- (a section of another part, or a provision that creates no offence, or a bare section number whose offences differ) is NOTHING: it points outside this range, or does not say which offence is meant.
-- Where the penalty of a summary-conviction limb is not in the section, the punishment is the one s 787(1) fixes, taken as an input (another part); the lists below say "(s 787(1))" where that is so.
-- s 155(2) has one limb with a minimum of five years if the other person is under 16 and none otherwise: both cases are listed. s 162.1(1)(a) has two indictable maxima (10 and 14 years): both are listed.
-- The limbs are listed in the order the text gives them (indictment first, then summary conviction).

§ `ss 150 to 182 the offences of Part V by provision`

@ref Criminal Code Part V ss 151 to 182 (the offence, penalty and class provisions of each section, gathered by hand: no locator)
GIVEN `the provision` IS A `Provision of the Code`
      `the section number` IS A NUMBER
      `the subsections it may be given as` IS A LIST OF STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` MEANS
        `the provision`'s `section` EQUALS `the section number`
    AND elem (`the provision`'s `subsection`) `the subsections it may be given as`

-- The class of the offence.
@ref Criminal Code Part V ss 151 to 182 (the offence, penalty and class provisions of each section, gathered by hand: no locator)
GIVEN `the provision` IS A `Provision of the Code`
GIVETH A MAYBE (`Class of offence`)
`ss 151 to 182 the class of the offence under the provision` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 151 (LIST "") THEN JUST (`s 151 the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 152 (LIST "", "(1)") THEN JUST (`s 152 the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 153 (LIST "", "(1)") THEN JUST (`s 153 the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 153.1 (LIST "", "(1)") THEN JUST (`s 153.1 the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 155 (LIST "", "(1)") THEN JUST (`s 155 the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 160 (LIST "(1)") THEN JUST (`s 160(1) the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 160 (LIST "(2)") THEN JUST (`s 160(2) the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 160 (LIST "(3)") THEN JUST (`s 160(3) the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 160 (LIST "(3.1)") THEN JUST (`s 160(3.4) the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 160 (LIST "(5)") THEN JUST (`s 160(5) the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 161 (LIST "", "(4)") THEN JUST (`s 161(4) the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 162 (LIST "", "(1)", "(4)") THEN JUST (`s 162 the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 162.1 (LIST "(1)") THEN JUST (`s 162.1(1) the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 162.1 (LIST "(1.1)") THEN JUST (`s 162.1(1.1) the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 162.2 (LIST "", "(4)") THEN JUST (`s 162.2(4) the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 163 (LIST "", "(1)", "(2)") THEN JUST (`s 169 the class of an offence under section 163, 165, 167 or 168`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 163.1 (LIST "(2)") THEN JUST (`s 163.1(2) the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 163.1 (LIST "(3)") THEN JUST (`s 163.1(3) the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 163.1 (LIST "(4)") THEN JUST (`s 163.1(4) the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 163.1 (LIST "(4.1)") THEN JUST (`s 163.1(4.1) the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 163.1 (LIST "(4.21)") THEN JUST (`s 163.1(4.21) the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 165 (LIST "") THEN JUST (`s 169 the class of an offence under section 163, 165, 167 or 168`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 167 (LIST "", "(1)", "(2)") THEN JUST (`s 169 the class of an offence under section 163, 165, 167 or 168`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 168 (LIST "", "(1)") THEN JUST (`s 169 the class of an offence under section 163, 165, 167 or 168`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 169.1 (LIST "", "(1)") THEN JUST (`s 169.1 the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 170 (LIST "") THEN JUST (`s 170 the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 171 (LIST "") THEN JUST (`s 171 the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 171.1 (LIST "", "(1)") THEN JUST (`s 171.1 the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 172 (LIST "", "(1)") THEN JUST (`s 172 the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 172.1 (LIST "", "(1)") THEN JUST (`s 172.1 the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 172.2 (LIST "", "(1)") THEN JUST (`s 172.2 the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 173 (LIST "(1)") THEN JUST (`s 173(1) the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 173 (LIST "(2)") THEN JUST (`s 173(2) the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 174 (LIST "", "(1)") THEN JUST (`s 174(1) the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 175 (LIST "", "(1)") THEN JUST (`s 175(1) the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 176 (LIST "(1)") THEN JUST (`s 176(1) the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 176 (LIST "(2)") THEN JUST (`s 176(2) the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 176 (LIST "(3)") THEN JUST (`s 176(3) the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 177 (LIST "") THEN JUST (`s 177 the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 180 (LIST "", "(1)") THEN JUST (`s 180 the class of the offence`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 182 (LIST "") THEN JUST (`s 182 the class of the offence`)
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): the provision is not an offence of Part V that this table names, or does not say which of the section's offences is meant

-- The punishments of the limbs.
@ref Criminal Code Part V ss 151 to 182 (the offence, penalty and class provisions of each section, gathered by hand: no locator)
GIVEN `the provision` IS A `Provision of the Code`
      `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction` IS A Punishment
GIVETH A MAYBE (LIST OF Punishment)
`ss 151 to 182 the punishments of the offence under the provision` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 151 (LIST "") THEN JUST (LIST `s 151(a) the punishment on indictment`, `s 151(b) the punishment on summary conviction`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 152 (LIST "", "(1)") THEN JUST (LIST `s 152(2)(a) the punishment on indictment`, `s 152(2)(b) the punishment on summary conviction`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 153 (LIST "", "(1)") THEN JUST (LIST `s 153(1.1)(a) the punishment on indictment`, `s 153(1.1)(b) the punishment on summary conviction`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 153.1 (LIST "", "(1)") THEN JUST (LIST `s 153.1(1.1)(a) the punishment on indictment`, (`s 153.1(1.1)(b) the punishment on summary conviction` `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction`))
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 155 (LIST "", "(1)") THEN JUST (LIST (`s 155(2) the punishment` 15), (`s 155(2) the punishment` 16))
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 160 (LIST "(1)") THEN JUST (LIST `s 160(1) the punishment on indictment`, (`s 160(1) the punishment on summary conviction` `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction`))
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 160 (LIST "(2)") THEN JUST (LIST `s 160(2) the punishment on indictment`, (`s 160(2) the punishment on summary conviction` `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction`))
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 160 (LIST "(3)") THEN JUST (LIST `s 160(3)(a) the punishment on indictment`, `s 160(3)(b) the punishment on summary conviction`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 160 (LIST "(3.1)") THEN JUST (LIST `s 160(3.4)(a) the punishment on indictment`, (`s 160(3.4)(b) the punishment on summary conviction` `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction`))
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 160 (LIST "(5)") THEN JUST (LIST (`s 160(5) the punishment on summary conviction` `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction`))
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 161 (LIST "", "(4)") THEN JUST (LIST `s 161(4)(a) the punishment on indictment`, (`s 161(4)(b) the punishment on summary conviction` `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction`))
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 162 (LIST "", "(1)", "(4)") THEN JUST (LIST `s 162(5)(a) the punishment on indictment`, (`s 162(5)(b) the punishment on summary conviction` `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction`))
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 162.1 (LIST "(1)") THEN JUST (LIST (`s 162.1(1)(a) the punishment on indictment` FALSE), (`s 162.1(1)(a) the punishment on indictment` TRUE), (`s 162.1(1)(b) the punishment on summary conviction` `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction`))
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 162.1 (LIST "(1.1)") THEN JUST (LIST `s 162.1(1.1)(a) the punishment on indictment`, (`s 162.1(1.1)(b) the punishment on summary conviction` `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction`))
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 162.2 (LIST "", "(4)") THEN JUST (LIST `s 162.2(4)(a) the punishment on indictment`, (`s 162.2(4)(b) the punishment on summary conviction` `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction`))
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 163 (LIST "", "(1)", "(2)") THEN JUST (LIST `s 169(a) the punishment on indictment`, (`s 169(b) the punishment on summary conviction` `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction`))
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 163.1 (LIST "(2)") THEN JUST (LIST `s 163.1(2) the punishment`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 163.1 (LIST "(3)") THEN JUST (LIST `s 163.1(3) the punishment`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 163.1 (LIST "(4)") THEN JUST (LIST `s 163.1(4)(a) the punishment on indictment`, `s 163.1(4)(b) the punishment on summary conviction`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 163.1 (LIST "(4.1)") THEN JUST (LIST `s 163.1(4.1)(a) the punishment on indictment`, `s 163.1(4.1)(b) the punishment on summary conviction`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 163.1 (LIST "(4.21)") THEN JUST (LIST `s 163.1(4.21)(a) the punishment on indictment`, `s 163.1(4.21)(b) the punishment on summary conviction`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 165 (LIST "") THEN JUST (LIST `s 169(a) the punishment on indictment`, (`s 169(b) the punishment on summary conviction` `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction`))
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 167 (LIST "", "(1)", "(2)") THEN JUST (LIST `s 169(a) the punishment on indictment`, (`s 169(b) the punishment on summary conviction` `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction`))
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 168 (LIST "", "(1)") THEN JUST (LIST `s 169(a) the punishment on indictment`, (`s 169(b) the punishment on summary conviction` `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction`))
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 169.1 (LIST "", "(1)") THEN JUST (LIST `s 169.1(4)(a) the punishment on indictment`, (`s 169.1(4)(b) the punishment on summary conviction` `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction`))
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 170 (LIST "") THEN JUST (LIST `s 170 the punishment`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 171 (LIST "") THEN JUST (LIST `s 171 the punishment`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 171.1 (LIST "", "(1)") THEN JUST (LIST `s 171.1(2)(a) the punishment on indictment`, `s 171.1(2)(b) the punishment on summary conviction`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 172 (LIST "", "(1)") THEN JUST (LIST `s 172(1)(a) the punishment on indictment`, (`s 172(1)(b) the punishment on summary conviction` `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction`))
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 172.1 (LIST "", "(1)") THEN JUST (LIST `s 172.1(2)(a) the punishment on indictment`, `s 172.1(2)(b) the punishment on summary conviction`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 172.2 (LIST "", "(1)") THEN JUST (LIST `s 172.2(2)(a) the punishment on indictment`, `s 172.2(2)(b) the punishment on summary conviction`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 173 (LIST "(1)") THEN JUST (LIST `s 173(1)(a) the punishment on indictment`, (`s 173(1)(b) the punishment on summary conviction` `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction`))
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 173 (LIST "(2)") THEN JUST (LIST `s 173(2)(a) the punishment on indictment`, `s 173(2)(b) the punishment on summary conviction`)
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 174 (LIST "", "(1)") THEN JUST (LIST (`s 174(1) the punishment on summary conviction` `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction`))
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 175 (LIST "", "(1)") THEN JUST (LIST (`s 175(1) the punishment on summary conviction` `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction`))
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 176 (LIST "(1)") THEN JUST (LIST `s 176(1) the punishment on indictment`, (`s 176(1) the punishment on summary conviction` `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction`))
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 176 (LIST "(2)") THEN JUST (LIST (`s 176(2) the punishment on summary conviction` `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction`))
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 176 (LIST "(3)") THEN JUST (LIST (`s 176(3) the punishment on summary conviction` `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction`))
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 177 (LIST "") THEN JUST (LIST (`s 177 the punishment on summary conviction` `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction`))
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 180 (LIST "", "(1)") THEN JUST (LIST `s 180(1) the punishment on indictment`, (`s 180(1) the punishment on summary conviction` `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction`))
        IF `ss 151 to 182 the provision is an offence of the section given as one of the subsections` `the provision` 182 (LIST "") THEN JUST (LIST `s 182 the punishment on indictment`, (`s 182 the punishment on summary conviction` `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction`))
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): the provision is not an offence of Part V that this table names, or does not say which of the section's offences is meant
